summary:
  A station is connected to for a reading ten seconds after the last one
  came home.

history:
  One more connection to a station is not free: one that limits connections
  answered 429 at five inside a second. A station is read once a day at
  most, whether the last attempt gave a number or not.

target:
  package/contents/ui/LoudLogic.js

find:
      if (nowS - last < RETRY_S) return false;

replace:
      if (nowS - last < 0) return false;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudlogic.qml::test_an_attempt_without_a_number_is_not_repeated_before_a_day_has_passed
  and tests/qml/tst_loudlogic.qml::test_one_more_reading_a_day_until_there_are_five.
  Line-neutral.
